                                "code": null,
                                "comment": "",
                                "message": "<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 447.75px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 33.3811%;\"><col style=\"width: 33.3811%;\"><col style=\"width: 33.3811%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 18.6562px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 18.6562px;\"><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">MFA Factor<span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 18.6562px;\"><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Recommended For</span></strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 18.6562px;\"><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Best Suited Environment<span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 74.625px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 74.625px;\"><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">FIDO2 Passkeys &amp; Biometric Authentication</span></strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 74.625px;\">Executives, security-conscious users, and high-risk accounts like admins, security admins</td>\n<td style=\"height: 74.625px;\"><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Corporate devices, managed endpoints, and environments requiring </span><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">phishing-resistant</span></strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"> authentication</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 74.625px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150px; height: 74.625px;\" role=\"rowheader\" data-celllook=\"4369\"><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Authenticator Apps (TOTP-Based)</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 204px; height: 74.625px;\" data-celllook=\"4369\"><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">General employees, remote workers, and contractors</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"height: 74.625px;\"><span style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Any environment where users have a smartphone and need a balance between security and usability</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 111.938px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150px; height: 111.938px;\" role=\"rowheader\" data-celllook=\"4369\"><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Hardware Security Keys</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 204px; height: 111.938px;\" data-celllook=\"4369\"><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">IT admins, developers, and users handling sensitive data</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"height: 111.938px;\"><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">High-security environments such as </span><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">regulated industries (finance, healthcare, government)</span></strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"> and </span><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">privileged access management</span></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 74.625px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150px; height: 74.625px;\" role=\"rowheader\" data-celllook=\"4369\"><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Email OTP-Based MFA</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 204px; height: 74.625px;\" data-celllook=\"4369\"><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Occasional users, non-technical employees, and backup authentication</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"height: 74.625px;\"><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">General business environments where </span><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">ease of access</span></strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"> is a priority but security risks are lower</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 93.2812px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150px; height: 93.2812px;\" role=\"rowheader\" data-celllook=\"4369\"><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">SMS OTP-Based MFA</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 204px; height: 93.2812px;\" data-celllook=\"4369\"><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Legacy system users and users without access to other MFA options</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"height: 93.2812px;\"><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Environments where </span><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">no other MFA method is feasible</span></strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">, but security risks (SIM swapping, phishing) should be considered.</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><strong>Best Practice</strong>:</span><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"> For stronger security, prefer <strong>FIDO2 Passkeys</strong>, <strong>Authenticator Apps</strong>, or <strong>Hardware Security Keys</strong> over Email/SMS OTP</span><span xml:lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\">.</span></p>"
